      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.21,
      "end_seconds": 6.42,
      "duration_seconds": 5.21,
      "text": "Doctor, hi, where would you like me to put my coat?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.29,
      "end_seconds": 13.55,
      "duration_seconds": 5.26,
      "text": "Alright, you're alright, take a seat. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 14.48,
      "end_seconds": 21.02,
      "duration_seconds": 6.54,
      "text": "Yeah, it's pain in my breastbone wound. I don't know what's causing it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 22.8,
      "end_seconds": 24.77,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "Did it come on recently?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 29.8,
      "end_seconds": 33.02,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "It's been going on for one week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 35.1,
      "end_seconds": 43.47,
      "duration_seconds": 8.37,
      "text": "Can you describe it it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 47.25,
      "end_seconds": 51.32,
      "duration_seconds": 4.07,
      "text": "I'd call it mild. Coughing definitely sets it off."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 52.95,
      "end_seconds": 55.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "Have you noticed fever or breathlessness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 56.25,
      "end_seconds": 59.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "no, no fever or breathlessness"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 61.07,
      "end_seconds": 65.49,
      "duration_seconds": 4.42,
      "text": "What about your tummy and bowels, anything unusual there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 66.74,
      "end_seconds": 69.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "No, that side's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 80.53,
      "end_seconds": 83.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "a few questions about your lifestyle now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 85.56,
      "end_seconds": 97.2,
      "duration_seconds": 11.64,
      "text": "I smoke roughly a pack every two days. I'm a plumber, lots of bending and kneeling. I swim twice a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 99.22,
      "end_seconds": 104.19,
      "duration_seconds": 4.97,
      "text": "has anything ever caused you a reaction? I mean any allergies"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 104.8,
      "end_seconds": 108.98,
      "duration_seconds": 4.18,
      "text": "Cat fur. I come out in... well, wheezing"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 125.89,
      "end_seconds": 129.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "What do you take on a normal day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 130.86,
      "end_seconds": 135.3,
      "duration_seconds": 4.44,
      "text": "I'm, I'm on clopidogrel, 75 milligrams, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 136.17,
      "end_seconds": 139.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "Any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 141.89,
      "end_seconds": 144.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "Heart disease, for two years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 145.87,
      "end_seconds": 146.69,
      "duration_seconds": 0.82,
      "text": "I follow."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 163.35,
      "end_seconds": 166.92,
      "duration_seconds": 3.57,
      "text": "Shall I check your blood pressure and pulse?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 180.19,
      "end_seconds": 182.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "sit still for a moment.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 203.79,
      "end_seconds": 218.21,
      "duration_seconds": 14.42,
      "text": "okay: heart rate 79, BP is 108 over 80. And weight 61 kilos, height 154 centimetres, respiratory rate 14, BMI works out to 25.7, temperature 36.6."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 219.91,
      "end_seconds": 223.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "okay, time for me to examine you"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 223.94,
      "end_seconds": 226.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "I'm just checking this side"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 233.55,
      "end_seconds": 241.89,
      "duration_seconds": 8.34,
      "text": "The chest wound has healed, the breastbone is stable, and the vein-harvest wound on the leg is a little swollen."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 245.17,
      "end_seconds": 258.98,
      "duration_seconds": 13.81,
      "text": "you can relax now okay, so my impression is this: I can't pin this down yet we're looking at recovering well after bypass surgery or a leg wound infection"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 259.95,
      "end_seconds": 264.13,
      "duration_seconds": 4.18,
      "text": "uh, what are the odds it's serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 265.73,
      "end_seconds": 274.37,
      "duration_seconds": 8.64,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like recovering well after bypass surgery, but I'd like to confirm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 283.57,
      "end_seconds": 310.68,
      "duration_seconds": 27.11,
      "text": "I think blood tests makes sense here, for post-operative review. Walk daily, no heavy lifting for six weeks and no driving until you are cleared. One warning sign to remember: the symptoms get worse. In that case don't wait. Let's plan a check in six weeks. Is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 312.46,
      "end_seconds": 314.07,
      "duration_seconds": 1.61,
      "text": "That's clear, thanks."
    }
  ]
}